# SHOT ENTRIES

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

Shot Entries are explosive penetration movements used to rapidly close distance and initiate takedowns while maintaining balance, posture and offensive control.

Within CAS, they are considered one of the highest-transfer movement drills for grappling-based combat sports.

---

# Philosophy

Successful takedowns begin long before contact.

The quality of the entry often determines the quality of the finish.

CAS develops explosive, technically efficient entries that maximize penetration while minimizing exposure.

